; Born, Not Made, Stage 3, ECO62 egg: the folded Kresling baby printed lying flat in the support gel of the womb, nose toward the stern
; egg frame, millimeters: x toward the stern, y port, z up, origin on the egg axis in the docking face. B is the boom carriage (x of the ECO62 foot, mm).
; same skin path as stage3_print.gcode, turned 180 degrees about the vertical and moved to the print site of the womb; the kit is placed before the first layer
; body plan: stage3_electronics/geom.py, 8 sides, 6 Kresling stories and one waist band; folded length 184 mm, deployed 280 mm
; layer 1.5 mm, 59 layers; the electronics kit is placed after layer 0, then the skin is printed around the kit and closes over the kit
G21
G90
M83
M200 D0
M280 P1 S0 ; tool: needle down, gripper open
; ---- pause: place the electronics kit (one pick and place, see the kit block of stage3.json)
M400
M280 P1 S180 ; tool turns: gripper down
M0 ; the kit is placed at X440.0 Y0.0 Z-280.8
M280 P1 S0 ; tool turns back: needle down
